t, they are looking for a treasure. Pointing in the direction of the treasure.\nCaptain Shuo Sango, wearing a camp hat, points in the direction of the treasure.\n\"Minnano mono, let's go! He is enthusiastic.\n\nCaptain Shuoh, who had found the treasure, shared his joy with his team members, \"I'm going to make a fortune! Now our future is secure.\n〜Now our future is secure. He was dreaming. The End\n\nHope to see you again!\nThe story does not have to have an ending, just the part about finding the treasure is fine.\nThe members of the team should be deformed forest animals (squirrels, rabbits, bears, etc.).\nOr, from the live archive of Sango Shuo, Kirby, Stuffy, Pokemon, etc....", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yagisobaco/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1ef3b98e/uploads/origins/c3ad684d-bbe0-4d45-9dbe-2c143a881c07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87e8d9c80f2ffc70b1a6674d1ca9ee8d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1ef3b98e/uploads/origins/c3ad684d-bbe0-4d45-9dbe-2c143a881c07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87e8d9c80f2ffc70b1a6674d1ca9ee8d, https://si.imgix.net/1ef3b98e/uploads/origins/c3ad684d-bbe0-4d45-9dbe-2c143a881c07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=191c314d87f5e96e7fc19bd3a99bd323 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1ef3b98e/uploads/origins/c3ad684d-bbe0-4d45-9dbe-2c143a881c07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c3a14523419a8dd5faaa274e6fafcc1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Snow White Mira dazzlingly protects her eyes from the sunlight pouring down from the heavens with her right hand.\nWhite bikini with ruffles\nThe lower frill is above the knees\nThe upper ruffles are connected to her arms\nWhite flip flops\nReal life-size\nBare belly button\nNo background", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yagisobaco/works/4", "thumbnail_sr